  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Nashville Blues**: rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- **Doc Watson Instrumental**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Last Day in Gettysburg**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Percussive Jam**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Loop Pedal Jam**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Salt Creek**: rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- **You Won't Be Satisfied That Way**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **That Home Far Away**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2015-12-18** (recommended): audience recording; 19 songs; 98 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Set 2 was by the Mr. Natural Project, and that set is left off this recording [1]\n- Set 3 featured Billy Strings playing together with Don Julin [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2015-12-18**: taped by rubyshantii; transferred by benatharius; source: AUD [FLAC16] [1]. Also: Processed in Audacity, with sound remastering by Del Ward [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings The Ark - Ann Arbor, MI - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/the-ark-ann-arbor-mi-5/) [3]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings The Ark - Ann Arbor, MI - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/the-ark-ann-arbor-mi-5/) [4]",
